** a steel cantilever (B3D2, 20 x 10 rectangle, h = 20 along the local y axis = global y) embedded with its root in
** a practically rigid block (C3D8); rotations tied to the host (rotations=axis); tip forces Py = 1, Pz = 0.5 and
** torque T = 20 on the 200 mm free part: u_y = Py L^3 / (3 E Iz) = 2e-3, u_z = Pz L^3 / (3 E Iy) = 4e-3,
** twist = T L / (G J)
*material, name=linearelastic, id=block, provider=marmot
2.1e9, 0.2

*material, name=linearelastic, id=steel, provider=marmot
200000.0, 0.3

